<title>HONG KONG: PT Bank Surya sets US$18.5 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>PT Bank Surya sets US$18.5 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger NM Rothschild &amp; Sons (Singapore).</p>
<p> BORROWER   PT BANK SURYA ACTING THROUGH CAYMAN ISLANDS BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$18.5 MLN  COUPON    6MS+145   MATURITY  2.5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	 LAUNCHED  WK SEP 23</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	   CALLS     NONE	REPLIES   08.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET    DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATINGS    NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD</p>
<p> NEG PLG    --	     CRS DEF   --	  FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  INDONESIA    GOV LAW   SINGAPORE PAY DATE  22.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES	THE BANK IS RANKED 18TH IN TERMS OF ASSETS AMONGST</p>
<p>		THE PRIVATE BANKS IN INDONESIA.</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS	US$5 MLN+     175BP    ALL-IN  215</p>
<p>   LEAD MGRS	   US$3-4 MLN    150BP    ALL-IN  205</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	    US$1-2 MLN    125BP    ALL-IN  195</p>
<p> ARRANGER   NM ROTHSCHILD &amp; SONS (SINGAPORE)</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
